  <Fragment slot="lessons">
<li>Label public, shared and private spaces explicitly. “Courtyard” does not settle access.</li>
<li>Study transit infrastructure as a possible neighbor, with engineering and operating partners involved early.</li>
<li>Test commercial rents and vacancy separately from housing affordability; lively storefronts are a goal, not guaranteed income.</li>
</Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="sources"><a href="https://www.kalkbreite.net/bauten/kalkbreite">Genossenschaft Kalkbreite · building and shared spaces</a>. Reviewed October 2026. Approximate counts are identified; population changes over time.</Fragment>
</CaseStudy>
